    "sections": {
        "description": "Storyo is a stylish and flexible WordPress theme built for modern blogs, online magazines, and storytellers. Its featured sections, elegant typography, and clean design help you craft visually engaging content with ease. Optimized for speed, SEO, and mobile performance, Storyo ensures your stories look stunning on every screen. Designed with customization in mind, it offers multiple layout options, color controls, and widget-ready areas to let you build a unique and professional website. Whether you’re sharing personal thoughts, news articles, or creative stories, Storyo provides the perfect balance between beauty, simplicity, and functionality."
